  "transcript": [
    {
      "id": "line-1",
      "time": 0,
      "end": 7.253,
      "speaker": "s1",
      "text": "Welcome back to Audio Notes. Today we are talking about building a creative habit that actually lasts.",
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "id": "line-2",
      "time": 7.703,
      "end": 14.547,
      "speaker": "s2",
      "text": "For me, the first step is to start small. Choose something you can repeat even on a busy day.",
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "id": "line-3",
      "time": 14.997,
      "end": 25.12,
      "speaker": "s1",
      "text": "I like that. Before recording this podcast, I spend fifteen minutes writing down three ideas. No editing, just ideas.",
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "id": "line-4",
      "time": 25.57,
      "end": 33.593,
      "speaker": "s2",
      "text": "Think of it as an appointment with yourself. You only need to show up. You do not have to wait for inspiration.",
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "id": "line-5",
      "time": 34.043,
      "end": 40.081,
      "speaker": "s1",
      "text": "What about the days when your energy is low? How do you keep going without burning out?",
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "id": "line-6",
      "time": 40.531,
      "end": 49.534,
      "speaker": "s2",
      "text": "Lower the difficulty. An imperfect draft is better than a blank page. A good system should make you want to come back tomorrow.",
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "id": "line-7",
      "time": 49.984,
      "end": 58.102,
      "speaker": "s1",
      "text": "That is our takeaway for today. Pick one small creative habit for this week, and give yourself room to begin again.",
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "id": "line-8",
      "time": 58.552,
      "end": 65.451,
      "speaker": "s2",
      "text": "Thank you for listening. Save the idea that speaks to you, and we will see you in the next episode.",
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "words": [],
  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "note-1",
      "time": 7.703,
      "text": "Bắt đầu thật nhỏ — ý chính cho phần mở đầu."
    },
